                    <num>20-1</num>
                    <heading>What this Part is about</heading>
                    <content>
                      <p>To encourage people to take out, and continue to hold, private health insurance, this Part provides that people may reduce the premiums payable for their complying health insurance policies by participating in the premiums reduction scheme in <ref href="#dvs-23">Division 23</ref>.</p>
